WEBVTT

00:00.059 --> 00:01.833
Hebu tufanye mifano

00:01.833 --> 00:05.001
ya kuandika milinganyo, ya zoezi husika.

00:05.001 --> 00:06.286
Hivyo sawali linauliza, "Andika mlinganyo

00:06.286 --> 00:08.703
unaowakilisha 11 zaidi ya a."

00:10.277 --> 00:12.955
Vizuri, tunaweza kuwa na a

00:12.955 --> 00:14.790
lakini kama tunahitaji 11 zaidi ya a,

00:14.790 --> 00:16.623
tutajumlisha 11.

00:17.766 --> 00:20.054
hivyo tutaiandika kama a jumlisha 11.

00:20.054 --> 00:22.406
Pia, tunaweza kuiandika kama 11 jumlisha a.

00:22.406 --> 00:26.041
Zote hizi, zitakuwa 11 zaidi ya a.

00:26.041 --> 00:27.697
Hivyo basi, tuangalie jibu letu hapa.

00:27.697 --> 00:28.716
Vizuri, tumepatia.

00:28.716 --> 00:30.537
Sasa tufanye mifano mingine.

00:30.537 --> 00:32.845
"Andika mlinganyo unaowakilisha jumla

00:32.845 --> 00:33.845
ya d na 9."

00:35.770 --> 00:37.569
Hivyo jumla ya d na 9,

00:37.569 --> 00:39.623
hii ina maana kuwa, tutajumlisha d na 9.

00:39.623 --> 00:41.345
Hivyo naandika d jumlisha 9,

00:41.345 --> 00:44.178
au naandika 9 jumlisha d.

00:46.630 --> 00:47.900
Hebu, tuangalie jibu letu.

00:47.900 --> 00:49.161
Vizuri, tumepatia.

00:49.161 --> 00:50.705
Tufanye mfano mwingine zaidi.

00:50.705 --> 00:54.691
"Andika mlinganyo unaowakilisha j toa 15."

00:54.691 --> 00:57.574
VIzuri, nitaiandika kwa alama za kihisabati,

00:57.574 --> 00:59.420
badala ya kuandika neno toa.

00:59.420 --> 01:01.227
Badala ya kuandika T-O-A,

01:01.227 --> 01:03.310
Naandika j toa 15.

01:04.370 --> 01:06.858
Kisha tuangalie jibu letu.

01:06.858 --> 01:07.898
Tumepatia.

01:07.898 --> 01:09.839
Tufanye mfano mwingine.

01:09.839 --> 01:11.018
Hii inavutia sana.

01:11.018 --> 01:14.768
"Andika mlinganyo unaowakilisha 7 mara r."

01:15.775 --> 01:16.721
Kuna njia nyingi za kufanya swali hili.

01:16.721 --> 01:18.269
Tunaweza kutumia hii nukta hapa,

01:18.269 --> 01:20.186
kuwa 7 mara r kama hivi.

01:21.291 --> 01:22.674
Hii ni sahihi.

01:22.674 --> 01:24.469
Pia tunaweza kuandika 7r.

01:24.469 --> 01:28.060
Kama nitaandika 7r, nayo ni sawa.

01:28.060 --> 01:29.399
Hebu! tuangalie jibu letu.

01:29.399 --> 01:31.117
Hii ni sawa.

01:31.117 --> 01:32.611
Tufanye mifano mingine,

01:32.611 --> 01:35.438
kama unavyoona

01:35.438 --> 01:38.038
tumefanya 10 na hii siyo desimali,

01:38.038 --> 01:40.291
hii ipo juu zaidi ya desimali.

01:40.291 --> 01:42.487
Ni kuzidisha ndiyo maana

01:42.487 --> 01:44.840
tunapoanza kufanya milinganyo, tunatumia hii

01:44.840 --> 01:47.403
badala ya kutumia x kwa kuzidisha.

01:47.403 --> 01:51.061
Hii alama ya x inachanganya,

01:51.061 --> 01:53.064
unapoitumia,

01:53.064 --> 01:54.694
hivyo basi ndiyo maana alama hii inatumika.

01:54.694 --> 01:57.111
Hivyo tunaandika 10 mara u,

01:57.990 --> 01:59.904
10 mara u, hebu tuangalie jibu letu.

01:59.904 --> 02:00.978
Vizuri, tumepatia.

02:00.978 --> 02:02.966
Hebu! tufanye mfano mwingine.

02:02.966 --> 02:07.455
"Andika mlinganyo unaowakilisha 8 gawanya kwa d."

02:07.455 --> 02:10.206
Hivyo tutaandika 8 na kisha tunaandika

02:10.206 --> 02:13.039
mkwaju kama hivi, 8 gawanya kwa d.

02:14.617 --> 02:15.732
Kisha tunaendeleaa.

02:15.732 --> 02:17.510
Hii ni 8 gawanya kwa d.

02:17.510 --> 02:20.081
Hebu tuangalie jibu letu.

02:20.081 --> 02:21.637
Tufanye mfano mwingine.

02:21.637 --> 02:23.341
Huu ni, 6 gawanya kwa b.

02:23.341 --> 02:24.470
Vizuri, ni kitu kilekile.

02:24.470 --> 02:26.867
Hivyo 6, natumia alama hii hapa.

02:26.867 --> 02:27.995
Ni kitu kilekile

02:27.995 --> 02:30.078
hata kama nitabofya alama ya mkwaju.

02:30.078 --> 02:32.157
Hivyo 6 gawanya kwa b.

02:32.157 --> 02:33.364
Tuangalie jibu letu.

02:33.364 --> 02:34.697
Vizuri, tumepatia.
